          %h3#in_topological_ktheory_2 In topological K-theory
          %p
            The
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/MSpin"} MSpin
            = succeed "-orientation" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/MSpin%5Ec"}
                MSpin
                %sup
                  %i c
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KO"} KO
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KU"} KU
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+K-theory"} topological K-theory
            is attributed to
          %ul
            %li#AtiyahBottShapiro64
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Atiyah"}> Michael Atiyah
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Raoul+Bott"} Raoul Bott
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Arnold+Shapiro"} Arnold Shapiro
              = succeed "," do
                %em Clifford modules
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0040-9383(64)90003-5"} doi:10.1016/0040-9383(64)90003-5
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://dell5.ma.utexas.edu/users/dafr/Index/ABS.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            The
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/MSU"} MSU
            = succeed "-orientation" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/MU"} MU
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KO"} KO
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KU"} KU
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Conner-Floyd+orientation"}> Conner-Floyd orientation
            ) is originally due to
          %ul
            %li#ConnerFloyd66
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pierre+Conner"}> Pierre Conner
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edwin+Floyd"} Edwin Floyd
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/The+Relation+of+Cobordism+to+K-Theories"} The Relation of Cobordism to K-Theories
              %strong 28
              Springer 1966 (
              %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/BFb0071091"}> doi:10.1007/BFb0071091
              ,
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=216511"} MR216511
          %p
            That ABS-orientation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi M
                  %msup
                    %mi Spin
                    %mi c
                  %mo →
                  %mi KU
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} M Spin^c\to KU
            extendes to a homomorphism of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/E-infinity+rings"} E-infinity rings
            is due to
          %ul
            %li#Joachim04
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Joachim"}> Michael Joachim
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Higher coherences for equivariant K-theory
              = succeed "," do
                %em Structured ring spectra
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://mat.uab.es/~aguade/bcat02/slides/joachim.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Discussion for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/real+K-theory"} real K-theory
            includes
          %ul
            %li#Kriz01
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+Kriz"}> Igor Kriz
              ,
              %em Real-oriented homotopy theory and an analogue of the
              %p
                Adams-Novikov spectral sequence_, Topology 40 (2001) 317-399 (
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.rochester.edu/people/faculty/doug/otherpapers/hukriz.pdf"}> pdf
                )
          %p
            The discussion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cobordism+theory+determining+homology+theory"} cobordism theory determining homology theory
            for the K-orientation is due to
          %ul
            %li#HopkinsHovey92
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Hopkins"}> Michael Hopkins
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mark+Hovey"} Mark Hovey
              = succeed "," do
                %em Spin cobordism determines real K-theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/HopkinsHoveyCobordismK.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %h3#in_kktheory_2 In KK-theory
          %p
            Discussion in
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/noncommutative+topology"} noncommutative topology
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-theory"} KK-theory
            is in
          %ul#ConnesSkandalis84
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alain+Connes"}> Alain Connes
              , ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Georges+Skandalis"} Georges Skandalis
              = succeed "." do
                %em The longitudinal index theorem for foliations
              %p no. 6, 1139–1183 (1984)
          %ul#BMRS07
            %li
              Jacek Brodzki,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Varghese+Mathai"} Varghese Mathai
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jonathan+Rosenberg"} Jonathan Rosenberg
              = succeed "," do
